msgid "VMXNET3 网络驱动"
msgstr "VMXNET3 network driver"

msgid ""
"``drivers/net/vmxnet3/`` 为 PCI ``15ad:07b0`` 提供原生 VMXNET3 网卡 "
"驱动。``CONFIG_VMXNET3`` 为 tristate，默认内置；设置为 ``m`` 时生成 "
"``drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3.ko``，带有匹配该 PCI 设备的模块别名。 每个匹配的 PCI 功能独立分配 "
"DMA 环、控制状态并注册一个网络接口；它们 使用既有网络设备接口和 IPv4/IPv6 协议栈。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/net/vmxnet3/`` provides a native VMXNET3 network driver for PCI"
" ``15ad:07b0``. ``CONFIG_VMXNET3`` is tristate and built in by default; "
"setting it to ``m`` produces ``drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3.ko`` with a "
"module alias matching that PCI device. Each matching PCI function "
"allocates its own DMA rings and control state and registers one network "
"interface; the interfaces use the existing network-device API and "
"IPv4/IPv6 stack."

msgid ""
"驱动选择 VMXNET3 revision 1 和 UPT 1，使用一条发送队列和一条接收 队列，不启用校验和、分段、VLAN 剥离、RSS 或 "
"LRO 等硬件卸载。接口 使用 1500 字节 MTU、软件协议校验和及轮询完成队列；中断保持屏蔽。 "
"目的地址过滤允许本站单播、广播和所有多播，以支持 IPv6 邻居发现。"
msgstr ""
"The driver selects VMXNET3 revision 1 and UPT 1 and uses one transmit "
"queue and one receive queue, without hardware offloads such as checksums,"
" segmentation, VLAN stripping, RSS, or LRO. The interface uses a "
"1500-byte MTU, software protocol checksums, and polled completion queues;"
" interrupts remain masked. Destination-address filtering accepts local "
"unicast, broadcast, and all multicast to support IPv6 neighbor discovery."

msgid ""
"共享配置和环采用设备约定的 DMA 地址及代际位，发送完成须对应最早 尚未回收的描述符；接收完成须指向本队列预期的缓冲区。异常索引或 "
"完成类型使该设备停止接收新的报文，避免复用不可信的 DMA 缓冲区。 QEMU 的 VMXNET3 模型将接收完成类型字段保留为零，驱动同时兼容 "
"该取值与设备协议的接收完成类型。驱动不接受分片报文，并在错误或 长度超出缓冲区时丢弃对应完成。"
msgstr ""
"Shared configuration and rings use the DMA addresses and generation bits "
"specified by the device. A transmit completion must correspond to the "
"earliest descriptor not yet reclaimed; a receive completion must point to"
" the expected buffer in its queue. An invalid index or completion type "
"stops that device from receiving new packets so untrusted DMA buffers are"
" not reused. QEMU’s VMXNET3 model leaves the receive-completion type "
"field zero, so the driver accepts that value as well as the protocol’s "
"receive-completion type. The driver does not accept fragmented packets "
"and discards completions with errors or lengths exceeding the buffer."

msgid ""
"设备停止时先同步 quiesce 和 reset，再关闭 PCI bus master 并回读； 未能证明停止时保留 DMA/MMIO "
"和模块所有权，以便管理器重试，而不 释放仍可能被访问的内存。设备命令是同步 MMIO 操作，队列满时发送 返回 "
"``EAGAIN``，不会无限等待硬件进度。"
msgstr ""
"When stopping a device, the driver first synchronously quiesces and "
"resets it, then disables PCI bus mastering and reads it back. If it "
"cannot prove that the device stopped, it retains DMA/MMIO resources and "
"module ownership for a manager retry rather than freeing memory that may "
"still be accessed. Device commands are synchronous MMIO operations; "
"transmission returns ``EAGAIN`` when the queue is full instead of waiting"
" indefinitely for hardware progress."

msgid ""
"``tools/test_vmxnet3.py`` 编译真实驱动主体并模拟 PCI、MMIO 与 DMA "
"边界，覆盖版本协商、链路、收发环回绕、错误完成、资源回滚、失败 STOP 保留和多设备隔离。QEMU/KVM 测试使用两张 VMXNET3 和一张"
" e1000e，验证 DHCP、IPv4/IPv6、并发 TCP/UDP 数据和模块卸载、重载。 宿主模型和 QEMU 不能代替 VMware "
"实际环境验证；物理硬件也未验证。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_vmxnet3.py`` compiles the real driver and simulates the PCI,"
" MMIO, and DMA boundaries, covering version negotiation, link state, "
"transmit and receive ring wraparound, erroneous completions, resource "
"rollback, retained resources after a failed STOP, and isolation between "
"devices. A QEMU/KVM test with two VMXNET3 adapters and one e1000e checks "
"DHCP, IPv4/IPv6, concurrent TCP/UDP traffic, and module unload and "
"reload. Host models and QEMU do not replace validation in an actual "
"VMware environment; physical hardware has not been validated either."

msgid ""
"协议字段根据 VMware Linux 驱动定义及 QEMU 的 VMXNET3 设备实现 核对：`Linux vmxnet3_defs.h "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3_defs.h>`_、"
" `QEMU vmxnet3.c "
"<https://github.com/qemu/qemu/blob/master/hw/net/vmxnet3.c>`_。 本目录的实现为 "
"ReliefNT 原创代码，遵循 Apache-2.0；不包含上述 GPL 源文件的实现代码。"
msgstr ""
"Protocol fields were checked against the VMware Linux driver definitions "
"and QEMU’s VMXNET3 device implementation: `Linux vmxnet3_defs.h "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3_defs.h>`_"
" and `QEMU vmxnet3.c "
"<https://github.com/qemu/qemu/blob/master/hw/net/vmxnet3.c>`_. The "
"implementation in this directory is original ReliefNT code under "
"Apache-2.0 and does not contain implementation code from those GPL source"
" files."
